<title>CHINA: China sets bond issue ceiling for infrastructure.</title>
<headline>China sets bond issue ceiling for infrastructure.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China has set a ceiling of 15 billion yuan on the issue of corporate bonds this year to finance construction of basic infrastructure projects, the China Economic Herald said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The quota, if unused by the end of 1996, could be carried over into 1997, said the newspaper, published by the cabinet's State Planning Commission.</p>
</text>
